    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents an array element in a JSON configuration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Inherits from <ref refid="class_element" kindref="compound">Element</ref>. Provides mechanisms to define constraints on array size, validate contained items, and specify ordering rules (increasing, decreasing, etc.). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
